Rules of Engagement — Pet Peeves & Golden Rules
:::

:::shape id=s7_col1_bg x=80 y=140 w=445 h=510 kind=rect fill=#1E293B borderRadius=8
:::

:::icon id=s7_col1_icon x=105 y=165 w=32 h=32 name="x-circle" color=#EF4444
:::

:::text id=s7_col1_txt x=105 y=210 w=395 h=420 preset=body align=left color=#F8FAFC
**Pet Peeves (What to Avoid)**

• **Unscheduled communication** for non-urgent matters.
• **Refusal of ideas** without clear reasons.
:::

:::shape id=s7_col2_bg x=564 y=140 w=445 h=510 kind=rect fill=#1E293B borderRadius=8
:::

:::icon id=s7_col2_icon x=589 y=165 w=32 h=32 name="check-circle" color=#10B981
:::

:::text id=s7_col2_txt x=589 y=210 w=395 h=420 preset=body align=left color=#F8FAFC
**Golden Rules (Best Practices)**

• **Notify me beforehand** for check-ins or calls.
• **Give reasons** for refusal & suggest alternatives.
:::